Package: m6Aswitch
Title: Integrating Isoform Switching with m6A Methylation Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Tarun", "Chikatipalli", , "tarunchikatipalli6@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: m6Aswitch integrates isoform-level switching analysis with m6A 
    methylation site-level quantification to identify functional rewiring of 
    m6A regulation across isoform switches. It bridges m6AnetAnalyzer output 
    and IsoformSwitchAnalyzeR results to detect which m6A sites are gained or 
    lost during isoform switches, with annotation for DRACH motifs, UTR regions, 
    and differential expression.
